  "test_output": "test_atomic_messages_reject_duplicate_and_replayed_phase (test_configured_a4500_group.CommonWallTests)\nOnly complete durable bytes become visible; duplicates never overwrite them. ... ok\ntest_default_entrypoint_refuses_unqualified_execution (test_configured_a4500_group.CommonWallTests)\nNew source does not silently enable existing/default/final workers. ... ok\ntest_exact_cold_staged_helper_union (test_configured_a4500_group.CommonWallTests)\nA fresh isolated child imports only the complete staged helper closure. ... ok\ntest_no_existing_numerical_or_single_card_source_edits (test_configured_a4500_group.CommonWallTests)\nRuntime completion changes only the group metadata interfaces and their fixtures. ... ok\ntest_nonoverlap_incomplete_or_nonfinite_group (test_configured_a4500_group.CommonWallTests)\nMissing workers, reversed/future windows and no concurrency are refused. ... ok\ntest_one_deadline_for_entire_multiworker_barrier (test_configured_a4500_group.CommonWallTests)\nThe second worker receives only the remaining common timeout. ... ok\ntest_total_work_over_one_interval_not_sum_of_rates (test_configured_a4500_group.CommonWallTests)\nDifferent worker durations still use the coordinator's common wall denominator. ... ok\ntest_coordinator_never_has_native_device_binding (test_configured_a4500_group.GroupMetadataTests)\nThe physical binder refuses a zero-GPU coordinator even with a synthetic device. ... ok\ntest_distinct_physical_group_and_duplicate_refusal (test_configured_a4500_group.GroupMetadataTests)\nDistinct raw member records resolve; one reused physical UUID is refused. ... ok\ntest_eight_job_one_worker_and_current_context (test_configured_a4500_group.GroupMetadataTests)\nEight logical job devices and one step selector bind physical minor three. ... ok\ntest_exact_eight_positive_partitions (test_configured_a4500_group.GroupMetadataTests)\nOne card/eight copies and eight cards/one copy retain all eight seeds. ... ok\ntest_explicit_step_commands_do_not_launch (test_configured_a4500_group.GroupMetadataTests)\nCoordinator uses documented --gres=none; worker requests one typed GPU. ... ok\ntest_global_seed_protocol_and_exact_eight_gate (test_configured_a4500_group.GroupMetadataTests)\nFixed total retains eight seeds; a smaller-count eligibility claim is refused. ... ok\ntest_live_ledger_required_before_any_query (test_configured_a4500_group.GroupMetadataTests)\nRemoving the actual own row fails without issuing a scheduler or GPU command. ... ok\ntest_missing_context_mapping_and_driver_capture_negatives (test_configured_a4500_group.GroupMetadataTests)\nNo context fallback, invented mapping or changed actual driver bytes are accepted. ... ok\ntest_ownership_resources_and_selector_negatives (test_configured_a4500_group.GroupMetadataTests)\nForeign ownership, changed counts and unproved selectors are refused. ... ok\ntest_zero_gpu_numeric_coordinator (test_configured_a4500_group.GroupMetadataTests)\nActual coordinator step TRES proves zero GPUs independently of the eight-GPU job. ... ok\ntest_real_warmup_origin_and_seven_windows (test_group_runtime.CounterTests)\nTwo full compilation calls imply origin20 and measured end90, never a reset to zero. ... ok\ntest_reset_zero_omitted_or_changed_warmup_refuse (test_group_runtime.CounterTests)\nA padded, missing, type-substituted or unstable compilation call cannot be hidden. ... ok\ntest_round_counter_change_and_float_substitution_refuse (test_group_runtime.CounterTests)\nActual group rows must continue from the same integer origin and complete optimizer work. ... ok\ntest_actual_release_receipt_precedes_valid_atomic_owned_inputs (test_group_runtime.LaunchRecordsTests)\nSuccessful synthetic release produces the exact unmodified runtime ownership schema only afterward. ... ok\ntest_failed_release_retains_attempt_without_success_sidecar (test_group_runtime.LaunchRecordsTests)\nA failed native release cannot look like successful ownership or become retryable. ... ok\ntest_missing_live_owned_member_prevents_any_query (test_group_runtime.LaunchRecordsTests)\nCached receipts cannot authorize querying an identifier removed from the live campaign ledger. ... ok\ntest_submission_fsyncs_three_ledgers_before_receipt_and_refuses_reuse (test_group_runtime.LaunchRecordsTests)\nThe actual private identifier/row files exist before successful held submission becomes visible. ... ok\ntest_duplicate_physical_prerequisite_refuses (test_group_runtime.MemberPrerequisiteTests)\nOne reviewed physical card cannot qualify several group members. ... ok\ntest_group_qualification_has_no_circular_prior_qualification (test_group_runtime.MemberPrerequisiteTests)\nThe separate zero-credit original qualification can establish, rather than assume, its actual members. ... ok\ntest_prerequisites_match_uuid_after_permuted_allocation (test_group_runtime.MemberPrerequisiteTests)\nThe same actual physical cards can appear under different later Slurm worker indices. ... ok\ntest_actual_process_record_strict_types_and_all_uids (test_group_runtime.ProcessControlTests)\nThe numerical process cannot be substituted by its wrapper PID or a floating PID. ... ok\ntest_default_runtime_entrypoint_is_inactive (test_group_runtime.ProcessControlTests)\nNo command-line default can launch a controller, coordinator or numerical worker. ... ok\ntest_exact_wrapper_wait_uses_only_pinned_handle (test_group_runtime.ProcessControlTests)\nA cleanup signal targets the saved descriptor and still waits for its exact child. ... ok\ntest_missing_controller_api_refuses_before_wrapper_creation (test_group_runtime.ProcessControlTests)\nMissing process-descriptor support must fail before Popen, not after launching a child. ... ok\ntest_startup_open_failure_keeps_child_in_registry (test_group_runtime.ProcessControlTests)\nA child exists in controller custody before a later handle-open failure can raise. ... ok\ntest_actual_preparation_writes_all_standards_without_submission (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nCommitted private helper bytes stage into a complete unresolved packet with no scheduler operation. ... ok\ntest_coordinator_never_has_native_device_binding (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nThe physical binder refuses a zero-GPU coordinator even with a synthetic device. ... ok\ntest_distinct_physical_group_and_duplicate_refusal (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nDistinct raw member records resolve; one reused physical UUID is refused. ... ok\ntest_distinct_python_and_zero_one_step_requests (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nOnly the standard-library coordinator uses -S; the worker retains scientific Python. ... ok\ntest_eight_job_one_worker_and_current_context (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nEight logical job devices and one step selector bind physical minor three. ... ok\ntest_exact_eight_positive_partitions (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nOne card/eight copies and eight cards/one copy retain all eight seeds. ... ok\ntest_explicit_step_commands_do_not_launch (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nCoordinator uses documented --gres=none; worker requests one typed GPU. ... ok\ntest_global_seed_protocol_and_exact_eight_gate (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nFixed total retains eight seeds; a smaller-count eligibility claim is refused. ... ok\ntest_literal_held_resources_and_duration (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nSeconds become HH:MM:SS and an explicit reservation remains in the held request. ... ok\ntest_live_ledger_required_before_any_query (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nRemoving the actual own row fails without issuing a scheduler or GPU command. ... ok\ntest_missing_context_mapping_and_driver_capture_negatives (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nNo context fallback, invented mapping or changed actual driver bytes are accepted. ... ok\ntest_missing_launch_review_refuses_without_process (test_group_runtime.RuntimePlanTests)\nNo source-only or old registered plan can launch wrappers without current 